## Why a Halo Changes Everything for a Radiant Cut

A halo on a round brilliant adds sparkle from the outside in. The round's brilliance is mostly concentrated at the table — the halo adds fire at the edges.

A radiant cut is different. Its 70 facets wrap around the entire crown. The stone throws fire from the table, the corners, and the upper girdle all at once.

Add a halo to that and you get two sources of fire — one from the center stone's crown facets, one from the halo diamonds. The result: more total light return from more angles than any other shape-plus-halo combination.

The other difference is shape. A round stone in a round halo adds width evenly in all directions. A radiant's rectangular shape in a rectangular halo adds proportionally more surface area. That's why the size increase percentage is higher than with a round.

For a full breakdown of the radiant cut's facet structure and why it behaves differently than other fancy shapes, read the [Radiant Cut Diamond: The Complete Buying Guide](https://diamondcritics.com/radiant-cut-diamond).

## The Halo Size Multiplier

A 1ct round brilliant in a single halo reads as roughly 1.2ct face-up. A 1ct oval in a single halo reads as about 1.3ct. A 1ct radiant cut in a single halo reads as 1.4–1.5ct face-up.

The reason is the rectangular framing. A radiant cut measures about 5.5mm × 5.0mm at 1ct. The standard single halo adds approximately 1.5–2mm on each side.

That brings the total visual footprint to roughly 8.5mm × 8.0mm — a face-up area that matches a 1.5ct solitaire stone.

This is the most important thing to know before you buy. If your goal is maximum visual size per dollar, a halo radiant is the most efficient combination in the market. A 1ct lab radiant in a halo at [$2,387](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/pave-diamond-halo-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-cushion-emerald-radiant-by-james-allen-item-314929?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) looks like a 1.5ct natural solitaire that costs [$9,000+](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29651855?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational).

